00:07:30.880 --> 00:07:33.180
they will have essentially time traveled to the future

00:07:33.180 --> 00:07:35.780
it's not quite as easy as shows like futurama make it seem

00:07:35.780 --> 00:07:38.060
but it is theoretically possible

00:07:38.160 --> 00:07:40.260
and that's time travel in a nutshell

00:07:40.260 --> 00:07:41.960
you really can move forward through time

00:07:41.960 --> 00:07:43.700
by traveling at an immense speeds

00:07:43.700 --> 00:07:44.940
